## Change 1 — Dynamic File-Type Accept Based on Selected Source Card

**Where:** `PipelinePage` → Section 2 drop zone & hidden `<input type="file">`

**Logic:**

| Source Card Selected | `accept` attribute | `multiple` |
|---|---|---|
| `upload` (Local File) | `.csv,.pdf,.json,.docx,.xlsx,.txt,.parquet,.mp3,.wav,.ogg` | ✅ Yes |
| `workspace` | *(no drop zone shown — path only)* | — |
| `crm` | *(no drop zone — CRM connection UI)* | — |
| `media` (Media & Diagrams) | `.png,.jpg,.jpeg,.webp,.gif,.bmp,.tiff,.svg,.pdf,.csv,.parquet,.json` | ✅ Yes (multiple images + datasets) |

**Drop zone label/subtitle changes** dynamically per source card:

- `upload` → *"Drop CSV, PDF, DOCX, JSON, Parquet, or Audio transcripts here"*
- `media` → *"Drop images (PNG, JPG, WEBP, TIFF, SVG) or dataset files (CSV, Parquet, JSON) here"*

**When `workspace` is active** → hide the drop zone entirely; show only the single local path input + an optional folder-browse button (`<input type="file" webkitdirectory>`).

**When `crm` is active** → hide the drop zone; show a CRM config panel (already rendered, no changes).

