## Navigation Flow (After Changes)

```
Home Page
  └── ▶ Play button
        └── Pipeline Page [two-column]
              ├── LEFT: Ingestion sources + upload + DB section
              │     └── "Test Query in Ask Vajra →" 
              │           → carries uploadedFiles → Chat (new session)
              └── RIGHT: Sessions Panel
                    └── Click session → Chat (existing session)
                    └── "+ New" → Chat (blank new session)

Chat Page [sidebar + thread]
  ├── File chips in input bar (from pipeline)
  ├── User types prompt → Send
  ├── Assistant response (agent trace + prose + deliverable)
  └── Follow-up input → appends next turn to same thread
```

